ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其八","author":"郑真","text":"向来翻忆战争时，江海茫茫远别离。\n白发重逢太平日，春台化日乐熙熙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24989,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其九","author":"郑真","text":"义勇祠前酒似池，鼓笳吹动赫人威。\n满身插得真刀剑，要与皇家作健儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24990,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其十","author":"郑真","text":"婚娶家家礼俗谙，东邻少妇嫁童男。\n园篱缚架开筵宴，借得船头一片帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24991,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其十一","author":"郑真","text":"斤斧山中日日操，求生莫问此生劳。\n草柴卖得钱三百，不怕城头米价高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24992,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其十二","author":"郑真","text":"养得儿男学务农，布衣褴褛发蓬松。\n兔园亦有村夫子，夜雨残灯教过冬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24993,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"人有为石梁谣者录成 其十三","author":"郑真","text":"淮水生鱼不论钱，弈坛醉倒唤棋仙。\n百年尽可为生业，仰戴皇家日月天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":24994,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"ti