:"君家书法已三传，琬琰文章到处镌。\n闻说贤郎当跨灶，银钩爱学柳诚悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25001,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永嘉林以竹四轴求题曰风晴雨嫩云 其一","author":"郑真","text":"浮空飐飐飘苍雪，倚石翩翩舞翠涛。\n林下唤醒湘水梦，凤凰飞下九天高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25002,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永嘉林以竹四轴求题曰风晴雨嫩云 其二","author":"郑真","text":"晓风浮动隔帘青，旭日晴梳翡翠翎。\n想见云中仙子降，佩声杂沓散空冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25003,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永嘉林以竹四轴求题曰风晴雨嫩云 其三","author":"郑真","text":"筼筜谷底记曾游，风雨空山夜半秋。\n有约佳人终不到，天寒翠袖不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25004,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"永嘉林以竹四轴求题曰风晴雨嫩云 其四","author":"郑真","text":"琅玕百尺舞云幢，风月襟怀共一窗。\n昨夜春雷初震蛰，龙孙长得玉成双。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25005,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐明皇按乐图 其一","author":"郑真","text":"笙笛筝琶按得齐，玉人歌舞绣筵低。\n三郎酣醉真妃笑，谁信渔阳泣鼓鼙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25006,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐明皇按乐图 其二","author":"郑真","text":"内家教乐醉春妍，梦入巴山万里天。\n檀板轻敲箫鼓合，金盆香暖浴儿钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25007,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题唐明皇按乐图 其三","author":"郑真","text":"沈香亭北昼冥冥，一曲霓裳醉里听。\n乐事不知忘国恨，秋风愁绝雨淋铃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25008,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题扇面","author":"郑真","text":"插天峭壁两门开，落木风高万壑哀。\n酒熟山家烦折柬，蹇驴正待过桥来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25009,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题观音像","author":"郑真","text":"吾家东近补怛山，大士神通海浪间。\n旧日同乡今作客，焚香日日对慈颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25010,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题便面小景","author":"郑真","text":"一天如水水如天，万壑春含绿树烟。\n桥上抱琴人欲过，山窗且复罢青编。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题竹","author":"郑真","text":"山中留得岁寒枝，冰雪棱棱不受欺。\n莫道此君无变化，春雷唤起箨龙儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题五花马图 其一","author":"郑真","text":"五花骢马锦云堆，踣铁蹄高识骏材。\n倦眼奚官休睡去，天闲好与共归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题五花马图 其二","author":"郑真","text":"淮南群牧惯攻驹，八尺真龙万足余。\n圣代郊丘崇报享，祇须宝络驾金车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跋丽水俞元吉所藏高彦敬临米元章越山图并序 其一","author":"郑真","text":"南宫跨鹤九天遥，云暗房山怅莫招。\n赖有吴兴书跋在，画图珍重似琼瑶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跋丽水俞元吉所藏高彦敬临米元章越山图并序 其二","author":"郑真","text":"浙江东渡指西陵，万迭天开紫翠屏。\n掉得扁舟归旧隐，夜凉光动少微星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":25016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]